th d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"step-text\"><span class=\"step-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15V3\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"></path></svg></span><h3>Simpan videonya</h3><p>Pilih MP4 atau MP3 yang tersedia, lalu simpan langsung ke perangkatmu.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"features-section\" id=\"keunggulan\"><div class=\"container features-layout\"><div class=\"features-intro\"><span class=\"section-kicker\"><span class=\"kicker-line\"></span> KENAPA TIKTOOKSAVER?</span><h2>Lebih simpel.<br/><span>Lebih menyenangkan.</span></h2><p>Dibuat untuk membuat proses menyimpan konten favorit terasa ringan, cepat, dan tanpa ribet.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#beranda\">Coba sekarang <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"features-grid\"><div class=\"feature-card\"><span class=\"feature-icon feature-violet\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15.914 4a1.5 1.5 0 00-2.474-1.561l-9 9A1.5 1.5 0 005.5 14h4.002a.5.5 0 01.471.666L8.086 20a1.5 1.5 0 002.475 1.56l9-9A1.5 1.5 0 0018.5 10h-3.997a.5.5 0 01-.472-.667z\"></path></svg></span><h3>Proses praktis</h3><p>Tempel tautan, lihat hasilnya, dan unduh. Sesederhana itu.</p></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><span class=\"feature-icon feature-pink\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path></svg></span><h3>Momen selalu dekat</h3><p>Simpan video favorit untuk ditonton lagi kapan pun kamu mau.</p></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><span class=\"feature-icon feature-blue\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-smartphone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg></span><h3>Di semua perangkat</h3><p>Bekerja nyaman di browser ponsel, tablet, maupun laptop.</p></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><span class=\"feature-icon feature-green\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><h3>Tanpa akun</h3><p>Tidak perlu daftar. Tautan diproses saat kamu memintanya.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"guide-banner-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"guide-banner\"><div class=\"guide-banner-glow\"></div><div class=\"guide-banner-content\"><span class=\"banner-kicker\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cloud\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z\"></path></svg> UNTUK PEMILIK WEBSITE</span><h2>Ingin punya website<br/>seperti ini?</h2><p>Unduh file proyek TikTookSaver dan ikuti panduan bergambar untuk memasangnya di Cloudflare Workers. Ditulis khusus untuk pemula.</p><a class=\"banner-button\" href=\"/panduan-cloudflare\">Lihat panduan lengkap <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"banner-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"banner-window\"><div class=\"banner-window-top\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>tiktooksaver.workers.dev</span></div><div class=\"banner-window-body\"><div class=\"banner-window-badge\">✦ LIVE ON CLOUDFLARE</div><strong>Your website<br/>is live!</strong><div class=\"banner-window-stroke\"></div><div class=\"banner-window-stroke short\"></div></div></div><div class=\"banner-cloud\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cloud\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z\"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"faq-section\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"container faq-layout\"><div class=\"faq-intro\"><span class=\"section-kicker\"><span class=\"kicker-line\"></span> PERTANYAAN UMUM</span><h2>Masih penasaran?<br/><span>Kami bantu jawab.</span></h2><p>Temukan jawaban singkat untuk pertanyaan yang paling sering ditanyakan.</p></div><div class=\"faq-list\"><div class=\"faq-item faq-active\"><button aria-expanded=\"true\">Apakah TikTookSaver gratis digunakan?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><p>Ya. Anda dapat memakai alat ini tanpa membuat akun. Ketersediaan unduhan bergantung pada video publik dan layanan sumber yang digunakan.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item \"><button aria-expanded=\"false\">Apakah saya perlu memasang aplikasi?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"faq-item \"><button aria-expanded=\"false\">Video seperti apa yang dapat diunduh?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"faq-item \"><button aria-expanded=\"false\">Bisakah saya menyimpan audio saja?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"faq-item \"><button aria-expanded=\"false\">Apakah hasilnya selalu tanpa watermark?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></section><footer class=\"footer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"footer-top\"><div><a class=\"logo logo-light\" aria-label=\"TikTookSaver beranda\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"logo-symbol\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z\"></path></svg></span><span>tiktook<span class=\"logo-accent\">saver</span><span class=\"logo-dot\">.</span></span></a><p>Simpan momen yang berarti.<br/>Nikmati kembali kapan saja.</p></div><div class=\"footer-links\"><div><b>Jelajahi</b><a href=\"#cara-kerja\">Cara Kerja</a><a href=\"#keunggulan\">Keunggulan</a><a href=\"#faq\">FAQ</a></div><div><b>Untuk pemilik web</b><a href=\"/panduan-cloudflare\">Panduan Cloudflare</a><a href=\"/tiktooksaver-source.zip\" download=\"\">Unduh file proyek</a></div></div></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> TikTookSaver. Dibuat dengan 💜 untuk momen favoritmu.</span><span>Tidak berafiliasi dengan TikTok. Hormati hak cipta kreator.</span></div></div></footer></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/15xrurgzs99gv.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/01xlw8hd842-c.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[3